==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Relay Base (Enemy Base)|Relay Base]].
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*3 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Large Red Ball]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Large Red Ball]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dark Wind]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*4 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns as the boss.
**12 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 2~5.33 seconds<sup>60f~160f</sup>.
**1 [[Large Red Ball]] spawns.
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**3 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**1 [[Large Red Ball]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**1 [[Large Red Ball]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Large Red Ball]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You'll get plenty of money, making this stage rather easy. Just spam a general anti red lineup. Recommended to get level 20 units, level 30 makes this stage almost trivial.

